flowchart LR
  Platform[Преподавательская платформа]
  Kafka[(Внешний Kafka broker)]
  subgraph Stockio[Stockio strategy service]
    HTTP[HTTP health endpoint]
    Config[Environment configuration]
    Runtime[Go service runtime]
