  Market[Market data publisher]
  Platform -->|settings and provisioned topics| Kafka
  Market -->|market.candle.closed| Kafka
  Kafka -->|registration / recommendation results| Consumer
  Kafka -->|market.candle.closed| Consumer
  Consumer --> Strategy
  Strategy --> State
  Strategy --> Publisher
  Registration -->|account.registration.request / heartbeat| Kafka
  Publisher -->|strategy.recommendation.created| Kafka
  HTTP -->|GET /health| Runtime
  Config --> Runtime
